// ▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄▄

#include <behaviors.dtsi>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/bt.h>
#include <dt-bindings/zmk/keys.h>
#include <locale/keys_pt_abnt2.h>

&lt {
    flavor = "balanced";
    tapping-term-ms = <300>;
    quick-tap-ms = <250>;
    require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
};

&sk { quick-release; };

/ {
    behaviors {
        hrm: home_row_mods {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-hold-tap";
            label = "HOME_ROW_MODS";
            bindings = <&kp>, <&kp>;

            #binding-cells = <2>;
            tapping-term-ms = <300>;
            quick-tap-ms = <250>;
            require-prior-idle-ms = <50>;
            flavor = "balanced";
        };
    };

    macros {
        os_focus_notification: os_dismiss_notification {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LG(R)>;
            label = "OS_DISMISS_NOTIFICATION";
        };

        os_end_session: os_end_session {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(DELETE))>;
            label = "OS_END_SESSION";
        };

        os_lock_screen: os_lock_screen {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp LA(LC(BACKSPACE))>;
            label = "OS_LOCK_SCREEN";
        };

        txt_assignment: txt_assignment {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_ASSIGNMENT";
        };

        txt_equals: txt_equals {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_EQUALS";
        };

        txt_nequals: txt_nequals {
            compatible = "zmk,behavior-macro";
            #binding-cells = <0>;
            bindings = <&kp PT_SPACE &kp PT_EXCL &kp PT_EQUAL &kp PT_SPACE>;
            label = "TXT_NEQUALS";
        };
    };

    combos {
        compatible = "zmk,combos";

        right_super {
            bindings = <&kp LGUI>;
            key-positions = <27 28>;
        };

        right_esc {
            bindings = <&kp ESC>;
            key-positions = <24 23>;
        };
    };

    keymap {
        compatible = "zmk,keymap";

        base {
            bindings = <
                &kp PT_Q        &kp PT_W            &kp PT_E         &kp PT_R              &kp PT_T        &kp PT_Y        &kp PT_U              &kp PT_I                &kp PT_O            &kp PT_P
                &hrm LGUI PT_A  &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_S  &hrm LCTRL PT_D  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_F  &kp PT_G        &kp PT_H        &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_J  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_K  &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_L  &hrm LGUI PT_SEMICOLON
&sk LEFT_SHIFT  &kp PT_Z        &kp PT_X            &kp PT_C         &kp PT_V              &kp PT_B        &kp PT_N        &kp PT_M              &kp PT_COMMA            &kp PT_DOT          &kp PT_SLASH  &sl 7
                                              &lt 5 ESC     &lt 1 PT_SPACE        &lt 3 TAB    &lt 4 ENTER  &lt 2 BACKSPACE    &lt 6 DELETE
            >;
        };

        navigation {
            bindings = <
                &none               &none                  &none                        &none                &none    &os_focus_notification  &kp LC(PT_MINUS)      &kp LC(LS(PT_EQUAL))  &kp LC(PT_EQUAL)     &kp LC(PT_N0)
                &hrm LEFT_GUI HOME  &hrm LEFT_ALT PAGE_UP  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PAGE_DOWN  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT END  &none    &kp LEFT_ARROW          &hrm LEFT_SHIFT DOWN  &hrm LEFT_CONTROL UP  &hrm LEFT_ALT RIGHT  &hrm LEFT_GUI PRINTSCREEN
&studio_unlock  &none               &none                  &none                        &none                &none    &kp CAPSLOCK            &kp F2                &kp F6                &kp F7               &kp F11                    &os_end_session
                                                           &none                        &none                &none    &none                   &kp K_MENU            &os_lock_screen
            >;
        };

        symbols {
            bindings = <
            &kp PT_PIPE                &kp PT_DOLLAR            &kp PT_LEFT_BRACE                   &kp PT_RIGHT_BRACE                 &txt_assignment    &none  &none                    &none                        &none                 &none
            &hrm LEFT_GUI PT_AMPERSAND &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_DQT   &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_LEFT_PARENTHESIS &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_RIGHT_PARENTHESIS &kp PT_EXCL        &none  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_EQUAL &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_PERCENT &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_HASH &hrm LEFT_GUI PT_ASTERISK
&caps_word  &kp PT_AT                  &kp PT_PLUS              &kp PT_LEFT_BRACKET                 &kp PT_RIGHT_BRACKET               &kp PT_BACKSLASH   &none  &none                    &none                        &none                 &none                   &none
                                                            &kp PT_GRAVE                        &kp PT_UNDERSCORE                  &kp PT_MINUS       &none  &none                    &none
            >;
        };

        numbers {
            bindings = <
       &none                        &none                     &none                      &none                   &none    &kp PT_DOLLAR   &kp PT_N1                 &kp PT_N2                   &kp PT_N3               &kp PT_UNDERSCORE
       &hrm LEFT_GUI PT_SLASH       &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_ASTERISK &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_MINUS &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_PLUS &none    &kp PT_PERCENT  &hrm LEFT_SHIFT PT_N4     &hrm LEFT_CONTROL PT_N5     &hrm LEFT_ALT PT_N6     &hrm LEFT_GUI PT_DOT
&none  &none                        &none                     &none                      &none                   &none    &none           &kp PT_N7                 &kp PT_N8                   &kp PT_N9               &kp PT_COMMA          &none
                                                              &none                      &none                   &none    &kp PT_EQUAL    &kp PT_N0                 &none
            >;
        };

        media {
            bindings = <
            &kp C_REWIND  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_DEC  &kp C_BRIGHTNESS_INC  &kp C_FAST_FORWARD  &none           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
            &kp C_PREV    &kp C_VOL_DN          &kp C_VOLUME_UP       &kp C_NEXT          &none           &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&bt BT_CLR  &bt BT_SEL 0  &bt BT_SEL 1          &bt BT_SEL 2          &bt BT_SEL 3        &bt BT_SEL 4    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &studio_unlock
                                                &kp C_STOP            &kp C_PLAY_PAUSE    &kp K_MUTE      &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };

        function {
            bindings = <
       &none         &none         &none             &none           &none    &none  &kp F1  &kp F2  &kp F3  &kp F10
       &kp LEFT_GUI  &kp LEFT_ALT  &kp LEFT_CONTROL  &kp LEFT_SHIFT  &none    &none  &kp F4  &kp F5  &kp F6  &kp F11
&none  &none         &none         &none             &none           &none    &none  &kp F7  &kp F8  &kp F9  &kp F12  &none
                                   &none             &none           &none    &none  &none   &none
            >;
        };

        shortcuts {
            bindings = <
       &none                &none                &none                &none                &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
       &kp LG(PT_N1)        &kp LG(PT_N2)        &kp LG(PT_N3)        &kp LG(PT_N4)        &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
&none  &kp LG(PT_N5)        &kp LG(PT_N6)        &kp LG(PT_N7)        &kp LG(PT_N8)        &none    &none  &none  &none  &none  &none  &none
                                                 &none                &none                &none    &none  &none  &none
            >;
        };

        accents {
            bindings = <
       &none         &none         &none             &none             &none    &none  &none         &none         &none             &none
       &kp PT_GRAVE  &kp PT_CARET  &kp PT_TILDE      &kp PT_ACUTE      &none    &none  &kp PT_ACUTE  &kp PT_TILDE  &kp PT_CARET      &kp PT_GRAVE
&none  &none         &none         &kp PT_C_CEDILLA  &none             &none    &none  &none         &none         &none             &none         &none
                                   &none             &none             &none    &none  &none         &none
            >;
        };
    };

    conditional_layers { compatible = "zmk,conditional-layers"; };
};
